cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VertiRTA in academic research, simulation, or software verification, please cite it using the metadata below. Research testbed only; zero airworthiness certification claim."
title: "VertiRTA: Bare-Metal Fault-Tolerant Run-Time Assurance, Formally Verified Coaxial eVTOL Control, Multi-Aircraft U-Space & Bilingual Contingency Testbed"
type: software
version: "3.5.1"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/fahrifurkansagir/VertiRTA"
url: "https://fahrifurkansagir.github.io/VertiRTA/"
authors:
